`user_store.py` must use `GREATEST(EXCLUDED.token_balance, u.token_balance)` in its `ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE` to prevent the bridge's cached `token_balance` from overwriting direct DB adjustments (Token Lab Quick Adjust, purchase credits). Additionally, `profile_data->>'token_balance'` is patched back via `jsonb_set` after the full JSONB replacement. This pattern was established after Feb 2026 when Token Lab adjustments reverted within minutes.

